        pub:passageId "pouring-variations" ;
        pub:text """PourWater, PourWaterAmount: For this task, both the controlled cup and the target cup are
modeled as cuboids without the top face. We vary the height, length, and width of both cups, the
distance between the controlled cup and the target cup, as well as the volume of water in the controlled
cup. """ .

